<p>Your physical form is but a mere extension of your mind, you can bend it at will for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 3, 4, 4, 5</acronym> turns.</p><p>While under the effect you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">12%, 21%, 28%, 34%, 40%</acronym> all resistances and have <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">12%, 18%, 22%, 26%, 30%</acronym> chance to ignore all critical hits.</p><p>On activation you also remove up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 1, 1, 2</acronym> physical or mental effects.</p><p></p>